	040011 DescSize         =0x1B1
	040010 Desc             ="Wide Open Throttle (WOT) Ignition Trim Map located at 0x2D8, the WOT trim map has 16 values for the following RPM: 520 560 600 640 680 720 760 2520 4000 4520 5000 5520 5760 6000 6160 6400. The formula for converting a ignition advance data point is DegAdvance=(X-13.95)*.6977 (see the Conversion tab). It is NOT recommended to exceed 30deg advance on these air cooled engines for this WOT map, these cars do not have a knock sensor!"
